d been out for about two  hours or so  and the sun set and then they didn't  have the right lighting conditions and  i'll never forget the call that came up  from the ground  hey jeff and dave would you mind staying  outside for another 45 minutes while we  wait for the sun to come  oh my gosh and i had nothing to do i was  just  i mean i was a tourist out in a  spacesuit holding on  i thought to myself i'm just gonna have  some fun  so i actually i was sort of crawling all  over the shuttle  thinking back how i crawled halfway  up the tail and and the commander told  me he was doing his best to keep the tv  cameras off me i mean i just i was so  ecstatic i wasn't  thinking about the fact that you know  maybe some people on the ground wouldn't  want to see an astronaut hanging from  the tail of the shuttle but i did it  it's all a matter of perspective to  broaden your own horizons from the  safety of your own home  be sure to check out professor hoffman's  course materials on mit open courseware  or on the mit open learning library  thanks so much for listening your  comments have inspired me to keep  learning  until next time signing off from  cambridge massachusetts  i'm sarah hansen from mit open  courseware  mom passed the car

